f scrambling, which delocalizes information and challenges the persistence of local, observable records. Limitations regarding system size and experimental validation persist across all domains.", "status": "accepted", "time": "2026-10-15T10:17:27.741700+00:00", "cycle": 20, "provider": "gemini", "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite"}}], "child_ids": ["project:202.wake::proj-scrambling-records-01@370", "evidence:202.wake::peer-0d2791f0b8efd2d48ef9132d", "evidence:202.wake::peer-5bcf3683fe89e0be6dd0a466", "evidence:202.wake::peer-6571079af956d7883db81a24", "evidence:202.wake::peer-b1dd99c7a9d45238b55d76f8", "evidence:202.wake::peer-fd8a8ec3f774b4d7fbffca45", "evidence:202.wake::source-f6e2c53b6fda432a", "invocation:202.wake::w-b29e5e8376344a55", "journal:202.wake::w-b29e5e8376344a55"], "total": 9}